Terminals unused in grammar

   INVALID


Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: function_list

    2 function_list: function_definition
    3              | function_list function_definition

    4 function_definition: return_type IDENTIFIER '(' ')' '{' statement_list '}'

    5 return_type: VOID
    6            | INT

    7 statement_list: /* empty */
    8               | statement_list statement

    9 statement: function_call
   10          | RETURN NUMBER ';'

   11 function_call: IDENTIFIER '(' ')' ';'


Terminals, with rules where they appear

$end (0) 0
'(' (40) 4 11
')' (41) 4 11
';' (59) 10 11
'{' (123) 4
'}' (125) 4
error (256)
VOID (258) 5
INT (259) 6
RETURN (260) 10
IDENTIFIER (261) 4 11
NUMBER (262) 10
INVALID (263)


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

$accept (14)
    on left: 0
program (15)
    on left: 1, on right: 0
function_list (16)
    on left: 2 3, on right: 1 3
function_definition (17)
    on left: 4, on right: 2 3
return_type (18)
    on left: 5 6, on right: 4
statement_list (19)
    on left: 7 8, on right: 4 8
statement (20)
    on left: 9 10, on right: 8
function_call (21)
    on left: 11, on right: 9


state 0

    0 $accept: . program $end

    VOID  shift, and go to state 1
    INT   shift, and go to state 2

    program              go to state 3
    function_list        go to state 4
    function_definition  go to state 5
    return_type          go to state 6


state 1

    5 return_type: VOID .

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (return_type)


state 2

    6 return_type: INT .

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (return_type)


state 3

    0 $accept: program . $end

    $end  shift, and go to state 7


state 4

    1 program: function_list .
    3 function_list: function_list . function_definition

    VOID  shift, and go to state 1
    INT   shift, and go to state 2

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (program)

    function_definition  go to state 8
    return_type          go to state 6


state 5

    2 function_list: function_definition .

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (function_list)


state 6

    4 function_definition: return_type . IDENTIFIER '(' ')' '{' statement_list '}'

    IDENTIFIER  shift, and go to state 9


state 7

    0 $accept: program $end .

    $default  accept


state 8

    3 function_list: function_list function_definition .

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (function_list)


state 9

    4 function_definition: return_type IDENTIFIER . '(' ')' '{' statement_list '}'

    '('  shift, and go to state 10


state 10

    4 function_definition: return_type IDENTIFIER '(' . ')' '{' statement_list '}'

    ')'  shift, and go to state 11


state 11

    4 function_definition: return_type IDENTIFIER '(' ')' . '{' statement_list '}'

    '{'  shift, and go to state 12


state 12

    4 function_definition: return_type IDENTIFIER '(' ')' '{' . statement_list '}'

    $default  reduce using rule 7 (statement_list)

    statement_list  go to state 13


state 13

    4 function_definition: return_type IDENTIFIER '(' ')' '{' statement_list . '}'
    8 statement_list: statement_list . statement

    RETURN      shift, and go to state 14
    IDENTIFIER  shift, and go to state 15
    '}'         shift, and go to state 16

    statement      go to state 17
    function_call  go to state 18


state 14

   10 statement: RETURN . NUMBER ';'

    NUMBER  shift, and go to state 19


state 15

   11 function_call: IDENTIFIER . '(' ')' ';'

    '('  shift, and go to state 20


state 16

    4 function_definition: return_type IDENTIFIER '(' ')' '{' statement_list '}' .

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (function_definition)


state 17

    8 statement_list: statement_list statement .

    $default  reduce using rule 8 (statement_list)


state 18

    9 statement: function_call .

    $default  reduce using rule 9 (statement)


state 19

   10 statement: RETURN NUMBER . ';'

    ';'  shift, and go to state 21


state 20

   11 function_call: IDENTIFIER '(' . ')' ';'

    ')'  shift, and go to state 22


state 21

   10 statement: RETURN NUMBER ';' .

    $default  reduce using rule 10 (statement)


state 22

   11 function_call: IDENTIFIER '(' ')' . ';'

    ';'  shift, and go to state 23


state 23

   11 function_call: IDENTIFIER '(' ')' ';' .

    $default  reduce using rule 11 (function_call)
